---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About ALFArhan General Trading Co. | Buyer-Oriented Trading Framework"
  description="Institutional-facing commodity trade coordination. Structured engagement, documentation clarity, and compliance readiness."
  lang="en"
  dir="ltr"
  locale="en"
  currentPath="about"
>
  <section class="py-24 bg-[#1b2230]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1140px] px-8">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl text-white" style="font-weight:400; line-height:1.2;">About AFGT</h1>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/80">Institutional intermediary profile and operating scope.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1140px] px-8">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl text-[#1b2230]" style="font-weight:400; line-height:1.2;">Overview</h2>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">Structured trade engagement model for institutional counterpart coordination.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 bg-[#f8f8f8]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1140px] px-8">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl text-[#1b2230]" style="font-weight:400; line-height:1.2;">Operating Footprint</h2>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">Coverage across defined sourcing and buyer corridors under documented workflows.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24 bg-[#1b2230]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1140px] px-8">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl text-white" style="font-weight:400; line-height:1.2;">Positioning</h2>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/80">Neutral intermediary positioning with compliance-aware communication standards.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-32 bg-[#2c2c2c]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1140px] px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl text-white" style="font-weight:400; line-height:1.2;">Engage With AFGT</h2>
      <a
        href="/en/contact"
        class="mt-12 inline-block rounded-full border border-white bg-white px-10 py-4 text-[#1b2230] transition-colors hover:bg-transparent hover:text-white"
      >
        Request Buyer Access
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
